irst mint holds the route;\r\n+keep_bookkeep completes the lease-only record, and keep_abandon removes it when that first mint raises.\r\n@@ -18,0 +21 @@\r\n+This also retires a crashed first call's lease-only record, which remains without a session id.\r\n@@ -20 +23,2 @@\r\n-a retired or absent record mints;\r\n+a retired, absent or lease-only record mints;\r\n+only an active or draining record resumes;\r\n@@ -35,0 +40,2 @@\r\n+a mint lands only while the route record still carries its own lease;\r\n+when another call took that lease over, the mint lands on nothing with reset reason store moved on whether that call still runs or has finished;\r\n@@ -37 +43,3 @@\r\n-A launch that raises retires the session it resumed (keep_abandon), guaranteed under lock contention:\r\n+A launch that raises retires the session it resumed (keep_abandon);\r\n+a first mint that raises removes its lease-only record.\r\n+This is guaranteed under lock contention:\r\n@@ -39 +47 @@\r\n-every locked read of the record (load_honoured, in keep_for, keep_bookkeep and take_warm_lease) applies a pending tombstone before anything else, retiring that session and dropping its holder's lease, and the lockless keep-warm read skips a marked record.\r\n+every locked read of the record (load_honoured, in keep_for, keep_bookkeep and take_warm_lease) applies a pending tombstone before anything else, retiring that session and dropping its holder's lease, or removing a lease-only record after dropping its holder's lease, and the lockless keep-warm read skips a marked record.\r\nApproved","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2584b99b-5c67-48ab-94cc-44374d289363","uuid":"7ed9c910-d7d9-4cfb-b02a-9c2a03c5f762","timestamp":"2026-10-06T23:53:46.535Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"6fd4e8bd WI-838: Answer adjudication 001's follow-up in the lane (the owner's 2026-10-06 ruling)\n16ecfd7e WI-838: LLR-270 states the general lease wait and release again (GPT Terra, round 4; adjudication 001's retur